  m_text: "<b><size=42><align=center>SHOPS</align></size></b>\n\nAt shops, you can
    buy and sell items. \n\nSome shops offer <b>special services</b>, like repairing
    weapons.\n\nLook around with <b>Left/Right/Up/Down</b>. When you see a point
    of interest, press <b>Select/Enter</b> to visit."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
